"Ludovico Sutto, Simone Marsili, and Francesco Luigi Gervasio. [New advances "
"in "
"metadynamics.](https://wires.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/wcms.1103) "
"Wiley Interdisciplinary Reviews: Computational Molecular Science, "
