msgid ""
"Once your `plumed.dat` file is complete, you can run the PLUMED driver on "
"the two MD trajectories as follows:"
msgstr "`plumed.dat` が完成したら、2つの MD Trajectory に次のように PLUMED driver を実行します。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:111
msgid ""
"The two `COLVAR` files can be analyzed using the Jupyter notebook `plumed-"
"pandas.ipynb` provided in the folder `notebooks`. This notebook allows you "
"to import a `COLVAR` file produced by PLUMED and to generate the desired "
"figures using the `matplotlib` library. The users are invited to:"
