"calculate the fluctuations (standard deviation) of the two CVs in the "
"different basins visited."
msgstr "訪れた各 Basin で両 CV の揺らぎ（標準偏差）を計算する。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:116
msgid ""
"__Are both simulations long enough to visit all the relevant conformations "
"or instead they remain trapped in different regions of the__ $\\phi$ / "
